# Backend Conventions

- Type-hint everything. Pydantic schemas for all request/response
  bodies. No bare `except:`.
- Business logic in `services/`, never in route handlers.
- Money: integer cents or `Decimal`, never float.
- Order parsing logic must follow @../../.ai/order-parsing.md exactly —
  raw text persisted before parse attempt, schema-validated structured
  output, confidence-driven status.

Full architecture reference: @../../api/.ai-knowledge/backend-architecture.md
